the show specifically rests in horrors monster sub-genre.

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:35.100
According to Aesthetecist Noel Carol, monster horror has two very important implications. 1: horror as a genre

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:42.280
Affords us a critical distance allowing for a safe space for fascination to take root simply put violence in real life is bad

