00:01:52.620 --> 00:02:00.000
simultaneously attract and repulse for the same reason. It's these two points that make berserk so well preserved.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:06.920
Why are we okay with witnessing Guts literally slice people in half? Because we view this over-the-top violence from a safe distance.

