00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:18.980
This blurring of typical categories and the fascination and

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:24.580
repulsion that it generates is Berserk's calling card. These binaries can be distinctions between life

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:30.910
and death; such as when Guts mows down a group of animated skeletons. Or the distinction between man and beast in the Apostles.

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:36.380
