While it might seem strange,

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:46.100
according to thinker Joel Black, an act of violence can, in fact, be

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:53.640
beautiful. In his book the aesthetics of murder he writes, "If any human act evokes the aesthetic experience of the sublime,

00:04:54.020 --> 00:05:00.020
certainly it is the act of murder. If murder can be experienced aesthetically the murderer can in turn be

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:06.400
regarded as a kind of artist, a performance artist or anti-artist whose specialty is not creation,

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:08.000
