they find hundreds of slave traders hanged as enemies of the state. Far from possessing beauty,

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:10.050
this scene is sterile,

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:18.060
methodically organized and revolting Schierke. Unlike Griffith though, Guts' violence is never part of a greater societal system.

