00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:34.240
In tying artistic violence to the individual, and unartistic violence to society, Berserk is challenging us on where we focus our attention.

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:39.280
While we're drawn to be shining brilliance of guts' violence or seemingly blind to the everyday

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:46.800
